# Root/shared Git ignore patterns (across all projects)
#
# NOTE: Environment/editor specific ignore patterns belong in global Git config!
#
# NOTE: Root Git ignore patterns are automatically applied to all projects,
#         and should not contain project-specific patterns (use own files)!
